<p class="lh">Enterprise technology leadership in 2026 is about disciplined acceleration: innovating quickly while protecting trust, cost efficiency, and operational resilience. AI governance, platform engineering maturity, FinOps integration, composable architecture, continuous compliance, and modernization factories are not isolated trends. Together, they define the new baseline for competitive digital execution.</p>

